* OWASP: [Sensitive Data Exposure](https://www.owasp.org/index.php/Top_10_2013-A6-Sensitive_Data_Exposure).
* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-201](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/201.html).

